{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_08",
  "title": "连接内心",
  "storyCode": "DV-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a7fff5d28ada598b737bd91d6b8f564d184df720b0b40e38b5db9780ed256c21",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g10_senioroffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们答应给我们投钱了，塞雷娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的演讲很出色。这些投资人都是被你描绘的前景打动的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前景......当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我用他们能理解的语言描绘了一些他们会感兴趣的副产品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "短短一晚上的时间，比在实验室待上十天还要累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暂时的忍耐是有必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等资金的问题得到解决，你随时都可以一头扎进实验室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你了解我，这就是我甘愿忍受这一切的唯一动力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，那位叫斐尔迪南·克鲁尼的学者对你的提案也很感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他会“在莱茵生命建起全泰拉最厉害的实验室”——他是这么说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我会欢迎他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我调查过他的履历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起学者，他更像商人。他恐怕无法理解你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，塞雷娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从来不需要别人理解我......甚至能遇见志同道合的你，都已超出我的预期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现阶段的莱茵需要更多能人，也需要更多项目。为了达成我们最终的理想，这是必要的积累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是总辖，你来决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐尔迪南的某些手段并不合规，现有的好几个项目还牵涉到与其他大企业以及政府的私下交易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于之后的合作守则，我会再与他好好谈谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你会帮我处理好的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是防卫科主任，这是我的职责所在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这次冒进会给你......给莱茵生命带来很大风险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚想到了几个新的主意，说不定能解决之前理论中的几处瑕疵——对了，塞雷娅，你刚刚想说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_202_demkni_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你，塞雷娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有你在身边，我才能心无旁骛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g10_senioroffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你并不需要任何人来救你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你还是来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又露出了那样的表情......你感到了愤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷娅，这些年在外面的经历让你更加情绪化了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本以为等你看清楚更多事实，你会更理解我的决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回答我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "359号基地的实验是你授意的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从来不会欺骗你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很清楚这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但你也并不在乎那座基地里发生了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你放任了斐尔迪南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像当年你放任了帕尔维斯的实验一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？哪一次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不记得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你从来不会记住这些无关你自己的研究的“小事”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人类的大脑空间很有限。对我而言，它还有许多更有价值的工作需要完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐尔迪南的小动作为我争取了一些清闲的时间，令我能够更专注地思考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这几天我的实验取得了很大的突破，你想听一听吗，塞雷娅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是不感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克丽斯腾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是......依然在牵挂那些无足轻重的人和事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们从来都不是无足轻重的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你永远没有办法甩开那些人和事的重量，克丽斯腾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为你我......还有莱茵生命都还扎根在这片土地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "为什么突然道歉？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你不会又改主意了吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心......我们是同一阵线的伙伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会对你动手的，至少现在不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是......我说不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克丽斯腾未必会站在塞雷娅一边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我听说她们曾是挚友。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
              "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你没见过莱茵生命刚成立时的情形......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
              "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "大家第一眼都是被克丽斯腾的光芒吸引，但塞雷娅才是那个默默支撑着眼前高楼的人哦。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我听说她们已经决裂。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
              "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "决裂......在总辖办公室轰轰烈烈打过一架，把莱茵大楼的天花板都捅穿了算决裂吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
              "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "可是塞雷娅是自己走出那间办公室的，站在她身后的总辖也毫发无损。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
              "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "那两个人......要是动真格的话，怎么可能是这样不了了之的结果呢？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是克丽斯腾不会在意斐尔迪南在做什么实验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我急于确认她的安危，所以才把你们往这里引......可我从来没把握克丽斯腾会插手基地的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因此白面鸮亲眼看见的基地真相至关重要。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "请告知莱特女士。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "总辖需要知道我们都“看见”了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你不仅是想让克丽斯腾知道基地那边发生的情况？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重要的是你们......罗德岛拿到了这则消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "莱特女士不想要这消息的话，还会有很多人想要。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "比如沙滩伞等其他与莱茵竞争的企业。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "比如烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "比如梅兰德基金会。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "信息是最值钱的筹码。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "掌控信息是自保的最好手段。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "只要莱特女士还需要保住莱茵生命。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她就必须插手基地的事务。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在来这里之前，你就计划着逼迫克丽斯腾动手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你说不定会被她记住哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "想要更好地合作，我们正好需要更了解彼此。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那或许称得上荣幸。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你非常自信......不，你是真心实意地相信着在基地里的那些干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "还有最后一个问题，缪尔赛思主任。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你在意那些实验吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你在意的又是什么呢？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Dr.{@nickname}，再怎么说我也是莱茵生命的生态科主任，很少有人会这么直白地问我这样的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......怎么回答比较好呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是没有秘密的话，我的魅力会打折扣哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我仍然没有收到白面鸮同步的信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，没空向你详细汇报了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我至少还有十位......不，或许十一位空心的敌人需要处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，还有一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍尔海雅跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她说不定会去基地......她看起来似乎有着自己的目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我们的判断是一致的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她比之前预估的还要危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......我的情况？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是机械臂有些微微发烫而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还没到真正的危急时刻，我不会让自己受伤的，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g11_monitoringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜，我会把你留在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为实验付出了许多，我尊重你的成果，你有资格与我一起见证它能给我们带来的辉煌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把整座基地......当作培养皿，置那么多拓荒者于险境，就为了那巨型造物的降生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了灾难以外，它又能带来什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我眼中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几公里外，银色几何体稳稳地盘踞在基地上方。\n它仿佛掀起了一场风暴，可围绕在它周围的不只是狂风，还有无数细小的碎屑。\n那些碎屑有的原本属于树木，有的原本属于建筑物和机械，可它们现在都成了类似的形状，悬浮在中心的几何体周围。\n这样的几何体，随时都可能出现在其他哥伦比亚城市的郊外，也可能突然降临在伦蒂尼姆或者卡瓦莱利亚基的中央。\n它颠覆了人们对源石技艺的想象，颠覆了已知的物理规则，也将颠覆本就在变化之中的局势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......时代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到的是时代。一个全新时代的到来，意味着机会和无穷的可能，也意味着新旧势力的地位更迭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的冒险并非为了我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迈入新时代的可以不是哥伦比亚，也可以不是莱茵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但到那时候，钱与人脉都将离我们而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们建起的钢铁之都会被来自其他国家的巨手撕碎，就像林贡斯一样成为新一代霸主的滋养品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们引以为豪的实验室会被拆成废铁在二手市场倒卖，莱茵的招牌会在无人问津的地下仓库中生锈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到那时候，我们再也没有机会去推动什么，去改变什么。所有的理想都会破碎，我们只能望着别人的背影度过毫无意义的余生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当时代决定要抛下谁的时候，不会顾念它的往日荣光，更不会盲信它的未来潜力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们能把握住的只有当下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g3_cottage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信号搜索中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "连接失败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......通讯依然没有恢复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生，我们已经被包围了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这片居住区恐怕坚持不了多久，就会和基地里的其他区域一样被抹平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "银色造物是由接入中枢的受试者的潜意识控制的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如我们强行拆除拓荒者们佩戴的紧急医疗环......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拆除紧急医疗环的风险等同于移除九号装置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那从外部干预他们的神经活动呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，风险太高了，他们的大脑极有可能因此受损。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使没有外面的银色造物......我也不知道该如何唤醒他们。接入系统的人很可能从此长睡不醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我......我和斐尔迪南让他们身处危险之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要救他们，我必须......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三十秒之后，我们将迎来第......第十次攻击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，它的攻击频率正在加快......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能再这样继续下去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有我......我可以......挡住它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "细小的沙粒密布在空中，就如同一座由流沙堆起来的堡垒，将整座小屋笼在其中。\n无数银色物质正趴在外面。它们似乎对这座堡垒感到好奇，不明白自己为何分解不了这层看似脆弱的障壁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你并没有挡住它......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是在用你的源石技艺不断地抵消它的侵蚀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "施术单元很快就会停止运转。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还不会......这么快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你对自己干了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......一次实验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你也植入了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......施术单元。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在邀请其他人进入实验室之前......我需要确保前置步骤的安全性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们在变换攻击方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是我们的一部分，它会好奇，也很擅长学习......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "外面传来更多撞击的声音，就像下着一场银色暴雨。\n沙壁上不断地出现缺口，又有很多细沙填补上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们需要其他拖延时间的办法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生，我来试试吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我到外面去，用我的法术去引开一部分——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格雷伊，这太冒险了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生，之前我在跟桑尼先生聊天的时候，我说过一句话——这句话陪伴我走过了这许多年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我迈出这一步之前，我怎么知道，外面就不是出路呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g1_outdoorbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我其实......我不知道自己能不能成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不定我会一下子就失败......我、我忍不住怀疑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可万一成功了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前辈们教导我，在怀疑自己的时候，我应该想的是，我......我曾经成功过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他深吸了一口气，抬起头，望向面前的黑暗。\n银色的几何体有着近乎于眼睛的形状，但他知道与自己对视的究竟是什么。\n那并不是什么新的智慧生命，也不是什么神秘的怪物。\n那只是人类技术的成果，可以被利用，被分析——\n毫无疑问，也可以被击败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......没什么好怕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的恐惧都是源于未知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你......你是源石技艺的造物，你是诞生于拓荒者朋友们头脑之中的副产物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是人们连黑夜都能战胜......又怎么可能会被自己的造物击败？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一点光芒从他手中亮起，迎着在头顶盘桓的阴影飞奔而去。\n相当一部分银色液体果然离开了拓荒者的小屋，与黑夜紧紧纠缠着，扑向他释放出来的光亮，疯狂地撕咬。\n顷刻间，那点光芒就被扯碎，只剩下孤零零的几缕逸进更深的黑暗里。\n可更多的光亮一次又一次地腾起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g3_cottage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......格雷伊是个勇敢的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他就像桑尼......还有拓荒者们一样，有着直面挑战的勇气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它的攻击强度又提高了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亮光只能分散它的注意。它依旧把我们视作目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在流鼻血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使没有感染器官，你全身的血管也无法支撑这种强度的能量释放......要不了多久，你就会内出血而亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我要保护他们，我愿意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你愿意付出你的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这并不是你用来感动拓荒者的说辞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......真的准备这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默医生，为了保护家人，你难道不会做出同样的选择？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经错过了一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会......我不会错过第二次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说你的母亲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些年，我反反复复地在想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在被沙暴吞噬之前，他们是什么心情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是和这些拓荒者一样，只能挤在狭小的空间里，绝望地等待死亡降临？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "要是我没有接受那则特殊的邀请，我是不是就能陪着母亲走到最后一刻？\n要是母亲有资格陪着我一同进城，她是不是就不会被困在那场风暴里？\n我的研究解决了许多原本不可能解决的难题，可我始终找不到那个答案——\n为什么得救的只有我自己？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g3_cottage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默医生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果......它真的是受试者们意识的集合......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我爱着它，就像爱着我的家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我为什么......听不到它对我说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙壁上出现了一道深深的裂痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "多萝西往前倒下，一双手接住了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多萝西，无论多么努力，你都改变不了你母亲的命运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过去的那场风暴......早就已经结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无人机将自己的身躯填补进了沙壁上的缺口。\n沙粒仿佛有了更强的生命力，迅速地组织了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多萝西，你不是想听到你的家人们的声音吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你应该去问那些受试者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等风暴结束，他们会告诉你他们的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g1_outdoorbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他的手越来越热，他知道，机械以超越限制的功率运转了这么久已濒临极限。\n可是他不能放弃。\n要是他在这里倒下，身后最后的孤岛也会被永恒的黑暗吞没。\n他要坚持住，就像多年前的那个夜晚，他要走得足够远，即使双手因寒冷而麻木，双腿因跋涉而剧痛——\n他要走到能将手中的炬火递到另一双手里的那一天。\n温暖的力量覆上他握着的手，帮助他稳定了能量的输出。\n是另一个人的源石技艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......白、白面鸮干员？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要支援，格雷伊干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不必警示此地的危险性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我向赫默医生申请外出之前，就已经计算过任务成功的概率。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多高？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将我的辅助作为变量加入以后，成功概率为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不用告诉我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是习惯了先制订计划再行动，我知道就这样跑出来有些冲动，但我没有控制住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "计算结果并不能预示一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格雷伊干员，最终能决定结果的，总是你往前跨步的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“冲动”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然无法确定我此刻的脑电信号的波动是否是由“冲动”引起，但是你的行动促使我也走到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白面鸮干员......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "更多光芒在他头顶绽放。\n这是超越理论极限的输出，是作为武器设计者的他自己和Mechanist从未计算到的数值。\n可这是他的源石技艺。\n从来就没有任何理论能够完全阐释源石技艺......因为这光芒不仅流经施术单元，更来自于他心间。\n这光最终能穿过失控的实验体，穿过黑暗，穿过云层，穿过一切未知。\n这个念头只是藏在电光中跳动了一下。\n格雷伊依然抓住了它——他感受到了可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接收到微弱的信号......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正在连接中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伴随着剧烈的震动，巨大的实验体移动到了众人面前。\n没有任何征兆，也看不清任何移动轨迹，它就是出现在了那个位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后退，格雷伊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听我的命令——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "赫默握住了格雷伊的另一只手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无人机腾空而起，聚集了随着格雷伊体力不支而瞬间散开的金芒，笔直地冲向遮蔽了天光的银色巨物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爆炸的声音如同惊雷，升到最高处的无人机化作无数光点，飘洒着坠下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......从埃琳娜那里学来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这样的魔术只能用一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这光......终究会熄灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鸮",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信息传送完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们最关键的任务是不是完成了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们做到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她伸出另一只手，牵住了白面鸮。\n光芒渐渐在他们头顶散去，露出了银色几何体巨大的身影。\n......\n可是它并没有前进。\n因为依旧有一层细沙堪称顽固地挡在他们与它之间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多萝西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你手里的是......紧急医疗环和试剂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是想将自己接入......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我想听听他们的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说过了，我不知道该怎么唤醒他们，到时候我同样不知道该如何唤醒你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许你会被他们的意识吞没，也许摧毁了这造物，你的神经系统也会遭受不可逆的损伤，也许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多萝西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是一名研究者。我愿意承受所有不确定性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我是你的医生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能眼睁睁看着别人拿自己的生命去冒险——"
